From edfd89cc8cb91b6168fb00a01fffa568cd7c4010 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Copilot Task Agent <copilot-task-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 09:39:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Organisation administration implementation from exact
 baseline

Permission matrix: owner appoints admins and controls grants; role title alone grants no unassigned authority. Explicit grants cover Team creation, membership management, reviews and answer approval at organisation, department or Team scope. Same-organisation targets only; pending join requests confer no access; department answer-owner authority and authorship remain intact. Team membership does not widen knowledge visibility; personal Groups/local content remain separate.

Migration compatibility: additive 0015 after 0014; preserve existing rows and ownership history without purge or rewrite. Existing admins receive explicit legacy_admin capabilities, never owner elevation. Initial owners require operator provisioning; no automatic owner mapping. Last-active-owner invariant is transactionally protected.
